---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro'

const lastUpdated = '24 May 2026'
---

<Site
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms of use for the SEQ Campers website. Listings are subject to availability, prices are estimates only, formal quotes confirmed in writing."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-eyebrow">Legal</div>
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
      <div class="rich-text">
        <p>
          This is a placeholder terms of use. SEQ Campers will update
          this page with the formal terms. The summary below reflects
          how listings on this website work.
        </p>

        <h2>Listings</h2>
        <p>
          Caravan listings on this website are subject to availability and
          may change without notice. We do our best to keep listings
          current, but cannot guarantee any caravan shown is still
          available at any given time.
        </p>

        <h2>Pricing</h2>
        <p>
          Prices shown are indicative only and represent the caravan
          base price as listed. On-road costs (registration transfer,
          stamp duty, dealer delivery, statutory charges) are confirmed
          in writing as part of a formal quote.
        </p>

        <h2>Configurator quotes</h2>
        <p>
          The "Build your spec" tool produces an indicative total
          including selected upgrade options. Final on-road quotes
          are confirmed in writing within one business day and may
          vary based on supplier pricing, your specific tow vehicle
          requirements, and other factors discussed during inspection.
        </p>

        <h2>Photos and specifications</h2>
        <p>
          Photos shown are of the actual caravan listed unless otherwise
          noted. Specifications are sourced from the manufacturer and
          confirmed by SEQ Campers. Buyers are encouraged to inspect
          each caravan in person before purchase.
        </p>

        <h2>External links</h2>
        <p>
          This website may contain links to external sites (e.g. YouTube
          for caravan walkthroughs, manufacturer sites). SEQ Campers is
          not responsible for the content or privacy practices of
          external sites.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms? Email
          <a href="mailto:admin@seqcampers.com.au">admin@seqcampers.com.au</a>
          or call <a href="tel:0753707933">(07) 5370 7933</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
